    "reason": "[ev-a6c7cf1b66c0] says only that the default log format in `util/log` changes from text to json. [ev-64591f703ecf] shows that the command entrypoints of every component were touched, but gives no flag names. None of the upstream evidence or section context names the setting that lets an environment keep the old format. That means the `--log-format` flag and the `ARGOCD_LOG_FORMAT` env var in the proposed condition are unsupported, and in a multi-component product the per-component setting names (flag, env var or argocd-cmd-params-cm key) may differ. To confirm or correct the exposure condition we need the PR diff or docs that name the log-format flag(s), env var(s) or ConfigMap key(s) for each component.",
